<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned all five auctions whereby it sought to drain 2.333 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    400   million  18 days   25.52 pct</p>
<p>    400   million  17 days   25.54 pct</p>
<p>    550   million  13 days   25.58 pct</p>
<p>    550   million  12 days   25.58 pct</p>
<p>    433   million   3 days   25.23 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
